  "summary": "详细介绍GPT Image 2的三种使用模式：从零生成、编辑单张图像、多张图像融合。",
  "cover": "",
  "content": "<style>\n.gpt-image-modes {\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n.modes-header {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 50px;\n  padding: 40px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  color: white;\n}\n.modes-header h1 {\n  font-size: 2.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n.modes-header p {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  opacity: 0.95;\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.modes-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));\n  gap: 30px;\n}\n.mode-card {\n  background: white;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.mode-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n}\n.mode-card.mode-1 .mode-header {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n}\n.mode-card.mode-2 .mode-header {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%);\n}\n.mode-card.mode-3 .mode-header {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%);\n}\n.mode-header {\n  padding: 30px;\n  color: white;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.mode-number {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 20px;\n  right: 20px;\n  width: 50px;\n  height: 50px;\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n}\n.mode-icon {\n  font-size: 3rem;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.mode-title {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.mode-subtitle {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n.mode-body {\n  padding: 30px;\n}\n.api-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  padding: 8px 16px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-family: 'SF Mono', monospace;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: #475569;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n}\n.use-cases {\n  margin-bottom: 25px;\n}\n.use-cases h4 {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: #64748b;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n.use-case-tags {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n.use-case-tag {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: #475569;\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n.use-case-tag:hover {\n  background: #e2e8f0;\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n.template-section {\n  background: #1e293b;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.template-header {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n.template-title {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n.copy-btn {\n  background: #334155;\n  border: none;\n  color: #e2e8f0;\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n}\n.copy-btn:hover {\n  background: #475569;\n}\n.copy-btn.copied {\n  background: #10b981;\n  color: white;\n}\n.template-code {\n  color: #e2e8f0;\n  font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n}\n.template-code .keyword {\n  color: #f472b6;\n}\n.template-code .value {\n  color: #a5b4fc;\n}\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .modes-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .modes-header {\n    padding: 25px;\n  }\n  .modes-header h1 {\n    font-size: 1.8rem;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"gpt-image-modes\">\n  <div class=\"modes-header\">\n    <h1>GPT Image 2 三种使用模式</h1>\n    <p>GPT Image 2 提供了三种不同的图像生成模式，适用于不同的使用场景。了解每种模式的特点和使用方法，可以帮助你更高效地生成想要的图像。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"modes-grid\">\n    <!-- 模式一：从零生成 -->\n    <div class=\"mode-card mode-1\">\n      <div class=\"mode-header\">\n        <div class=\"mode-number\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"mode-icon\">🎨</div>\n        <h2 class=\"mode-title\">从零生成</h2>\n        <p class=\"mode-subtitle\">Text-to-Image</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mode-body\">\n        <div class=\"api-badge\">openai/gpt-image-2</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"use-cases\">\n          <h4>适用场景</h4>\n          <div class=\"use-case-tags\">\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">社论照片</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">海报</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">产品场景</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">概念艺术</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">标志</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">UI截图</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">插画</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"template-section\">\n          <div class=\"template-header\">\n            <span class=\"template-title\">提示词模板</span>\n            <button class=\"copy-btn\" onclick=\"navigator.clipboard.writeText('Scene: [场景描述]\\nSubject: [主体描述]\\nImportant details: [重要细节]\\nUse case: [用途]\\nConstraints: [约束条件]'); this.innerHTML='✓ 已复制'; this.classList.add('copied'); setTimeout(() => { this.innerHTML='📋 复制'; this.classList.remove('copied'); }, 2000);\">\n              📋 复制\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"template-code\"><span class=\"keyword\">Scene:</span> <span class=\"value\">[场景描述]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Subject:</span> <span class=\"value\">[主体描述]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Important details:</span> <span class=\"value\">[重要细节]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Use case:</span> <span class=\"value\">[用途]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Constraints:</span> <span class=\"value\">[约束条件]</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 模式二：编辑单张图像 -->\n    <div class=\"mode-card mode-2\">\n      <div class=\"mode-header\">\n        <div class=\"mode-number\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"mode-icon\">✏️</div>\n        <h2 class=\"mode-title\">编辑单张图像</h2>\n        <p class=\"mode-subtitle\">Image Editing</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mode-body\">\n        <div class=\"api-badge\">openai/gpt-image-2/edit</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"use-cases\">\n          <h4>适用场景</h4>\n          <div class=\"use-case-tags\">\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">替换物体</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">更换服装</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">移除杂物</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">重新打光</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">替换天气</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">替换季节</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">清理背景</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"template-section\">\n          <div class=\"template-header\">\n            <span class=\"template-title\">提示词模板</span>\n            <button class=\"copy-btn\" onclick=\"navigator.clipboard.writeText('Change: [确切应更改什么]\\nPreserve: [脸部、身份、姿势、光线、取景、背景等]\\nConstraints: [无多余物体、无重新设计等]'); this.innerHTML='✓ 已复制'; this.classList.add('copied'); setTimeout(() => { this.innerHTML='📋 复制'; this.classList.remove('copied'); }, 2000);\">\n              📋 复制\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"template-code\"><span class=\"keyword\">Change:</span> <span class=\"value\">[确切应更改什么]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Preserve:</span> <span class=\"value\">[脸部、身份、姿势、光线、取景、背景等]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Constraints:</span> <span class=\"value\">[无多余物体、无重新设计等]</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 模式三：组合多张图像 -->\n    <div class=\"mode-card mode-3\">\n      <div class=\"mode-header\">\n        <div class=\"mode-number\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"mode-icon\">🔀</div>\n        <h2 class=\"mode-title\">组合多张图像</h2>\n        <p class=\"mode-subtitle\">Multi-Image</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mode-body\">\n        <div class=\"api-badge\">openai/gpt-image-2/edit</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"use-cases\">\n          <h4>适用场景</h4>\n          <div class=\"use-case-tags\">\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">虚拟试穿</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">风格迁移</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">合成</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">插入</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">风格参考混合</span>\n            <span class=\"use-case-tag\">内容源混合</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"template-section\">\n          <div class=\"template-header\">\n            <span class=\"template-title\">提示词模板</span>\n            <button class=\"copy-btn\" onclick=\"navigator.clipboard.writeText('Image 1: [角色描述]\\nImage 2: [角色描述]\\nInstruction: [具体指令]\\nPreserve: [保留内容]\\nConstraints: [约束条件]'); this.innerHTML='✓ 已复制'; this.classList.add('copied'); setTimeout(() => { this.innerHTML='📋 复制'; this.classList.remove('copied'); }, 2000);\">\n              📋 复制\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"template-code\"><span class=\"keyword\">Image 1:</span> <span class=\"value\">[角色描述]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Image 2:</span> <span class=\"value\">[角色描述]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Instruction:</span> <span class=\"value\">[具体指令]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Preserve:</span> <span class=\"value\">[保留内容]</span>\n<span class=\"keyword\">Constraints:</span> <span class=\"value\">[约束条件]</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
}
